{"id":"cata_strofe","lemma":"catástrofe","pos":"noun","rank":4989,"glosses":["catastrophe, disaster"],"ipa":"/kaˈtastɾofe/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"catástrofes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cat%C3%A1strofe.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto es una catástrofe.","en":"This is a catastrophe.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461175","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"¡Qué catástrofe!","en":"What a disaster!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442251","words":[{"g":"what"},null]},{"text":"Una catástrofe ha sido impedida.","en":"A catastrophe has been averted.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Pocos pasajeros sobrevivieron a la catástrofe.","en":"Few passengers survived the catastrophe.","words":[{"g":"little, not much","l":"poco"},{"g":"transient, passing","l":"pasajero"},{"g":"to survive","l":"sobrevivir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La inundación fue la peor catástrofe que jamás hayan tenido.","en":"The flood was the greatest disaster they had ever had.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"inundation"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bad","l":"malo"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"}]}]}